    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Many Korean politicians are corrupt and accept bribes.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The two main parties of Korea, the Democrats and the Republicans, fight a lot.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "These problems are not only the politician’s responsibility, but the people’s as well.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We must learn to work together to make Korea the best country it can be.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PASS-OFF FOR WOMAN",
      "lang": "en"
